因自請往荊州迎喪柩，朝議以在位重臣，難令出境，乃遣長兄君嚴往焉。及還，將葬，詔贈巡侍中、領軍將軍，諡曰敬子。其年起君理為信威將軍、左衛將軍。又起為持節、都督東衡衡二州諸軍事、仁威將軍、東衡州刺史，領始興內史。又起為明威將軍、中書令。前後奪情者三，並不就。","note":"依本段敘事、稱謂及語者受者定。","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001","text":"沈君理字仲倫，吳興人也。祖僧畟，梁左民尚書。父巡，素與高祖相善，梁太清中為東陽太守。侯景平後，元帝徵為少府卿。荊州陷，蕭詧署金紫光祿大夫。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":11,"last_line":11,"raw_start":179,"raw_end":248,"raw_character_offsets":[179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243,244,245,246,247],"revision_id":1514496},"mentions":[{"id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"沈君理","kind":"person","person_id":"9wm_vgh_vz1_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"仲倫","kind":"person","person_id":"9wm_vgh_vz1_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"僧畟","kind":"person","person_id":"9wm_vgh_vz1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"巡","kind":"person","person_id":"9wm_vgh_vz1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"3eu_ixs_h1w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"侯景","kind":"person","person_id":"5d1_8jg_amy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"元帝","kind":"person","person_id":"rvc_bqx_v5w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"蕭詧","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4_B","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496"},{"id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p002","text":"君理美風儀，博涉經史，有識鑒。起家湘東王法曹參軍。高祖鎮南徐州，巡遣君理自東陽謁于高祖，高祖器之，命尚會稽長公主，辟為府西曹掾。稍遷中衛豫章王從事中郎，尋加明威將軍，兼尚書吏部侍郎。遷給事黃門侍郎，監吳郡。高祖受禪，拜駙馬都尉，封永安亭侯。出為吳郡太守。是時兵革未寧，百姓荒弊，軍國之用，咸資東境，君理招集士卒，脩治器械，民下悅附，深以幹理見稱。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":13,"last_line":13,"raw_start":252,"raw_end":425,"raw_character_offsets":[252,253,254,255,256,257,258,259,260,261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274,275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,284,285,286,287,288,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299,300,301,302,303,304,305,306,307,308,309,310,311,312,313,314,315,316,317,318,319,320,321,322,323,324,325,326,327,328,329,330,331,332,333,334,335,336,337,338,339,340,341,342,343,344,345,346,347,348,349,350,351,352,353,354,355,356,357,358,359,360,361,362,363,364,365,366,367,368,369,370,371,372,373,374,375,376,377,378,379,380,381,382,383,384,385,386,387,388,389,390,391,392,393,394,395,396,397,398,399,400,401,402,403,404,405,406,407,408,409,410,411,412,413,414,415,416,417,418,419,420,421,422,423,424],"revision_id":1514496},"mentions":[{"id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"君理","kind":"person","person_id":"9wm_vgh_vz1_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p002:m0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"湘東王","kind":"person","person_id":"rvc_bqx_v5w","status":"cont